{
  "id": "ui_ux_pro_max",
  "name": "UI/UX Pro Max (Design System & UX Intelligence)",
  "description": "Searchable UI/UX design system generator, color/font pairings, 22 tech stacks, and pre-delivery UX audit",
  "manifest_remote_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Reff33/ContextRig/testing/skills_library/ui_ux_pro_max.json",
  "ai_instructions": "Follow the UI/UX Pro Max workflow (full guide in rigtools/ui_ux_pro_max/SKILL.md; detailed rules in rigtools/ui_ux_pro_max/references/quick-reference.md and rigtools/ui_ux_pro_max/references/pro-rules.md). Before designing or building UI:\n1. Generate a cohesive design system first: run `python rigtools/ui_ux_pro_max/scripts/search.py \"<product_type> <industry> <keywords>\" --design-system -p \"<Project Name>\"` (add `--persist --output-dir .` to save `design-system/<slug>/MASTER.md`).\n2. Query stack or domain specifics as needed: `--stack <nextjs|react|html-tailwind|shadcn|vue|svelte|laravel|flutter|react-native>` or `--domain <style|color|typography|chart|landing|ux|icons|motion>`.\n3. Enforce pre-delivery checks: no OS emojis as UI icons (use SVG), minimum 4.5:1 text contrast, visible keyboard focus, `prefers-reduced-motion`, and responsive breakpoints (375px, 768px, 1024px, 1440px).",
  "claude_command": {
    "name": "ui-ux",
    "content": "# /ui-ux <product_or_page_brief> [--stack <stack>]\n\nGenerate and apply a UI/UX Pro Max design system:\n\n1. Run: `python rigtools/ui_ux_pro_max/scripts/search.py \"<product_type> <industry> <keywords>\" --design-system -p \"<Project Name>\" --persist --output-dir .`\n2. If a tech stack applies, query stack guidelines: `python rigtools/ui_ux_pro_max/scripts/search.py \"<keywords>\" --stack <stack>`\n3. Consult `rigtools/ui_ux_pro_max/references/quick-reference.md` and `rigtools/ui_ux_pro_max/references/pro-rules.md` for accessibility, contrast, and interaction polish.\n4. Implement UI using only SVG icons (no OS emojis), verified color contrast, keyboard focus states, and responsive layout."
  },
